## TROUBLESHOOTING

### BEFORE CALLING FOR SERVICE

Check the following list to be sure a service call is necessary. Reviewing additional information on items to check may prevent an unneeded service call.

<PIC:Manual24_57>
{{image description: Troubleshooting table with columns Problem and Possible Causes. Visible problem rows include oven not operating, interior light not working, oven not cooking, food cooking unevenly, undercooked or overcooked food, arcing sparks, display counting down but oven not cooking, and vent fan starting automatically.}}

